134 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 663 0 R
/E (Enforcement has scaled sharply but remains well short of stated targets. ICE's FY2026 budget request sought funding for 1,000,000 removals per year; through nine months of FY2026, the agency's own data show a pace less than half that rate.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [3]
>>
