/E (Oversight has not kept pace with the buildup in capacity. Five facilities holding 433 people carry a failed final inspection rating, and forty-two facilities holding 3,669 people have no final inspection rating on record at all. The bar for a passing rating appears low in practice: Winn Correctional Center in Louisiana passed its inspection cycles despite contemporaneous reports of staff placing detainees in chokeholds, discolored water, improperly stored food, and uninhabitable sleeping conditions.)
/Pg 20 0 R
/K [2 372 0 R 4]
