1080 0 obj
<<
/Title (ICE separately assigns detainees a threat rating from 1 \(most serious\) to 3 \(least serious\) based on the severity and recency of criminal history. As of a July 9, 2026 snapshot limited to non-specialty facilities with at least one detainee, 72.1 percent of the population, or 45,058 people, had no threat level assigned at all; only 12.3 percent were rated Level 1.)
/Dest [15 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1069 0 R
/Next 1089 0 R
>>
